'''''Olive, Cast to the Conference Chair''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Through the Petals in the Land of Repose]].

==Steps==
# Meet with the Council of Elders's messenger
# Follow Lygus and head to Dawncloud
# Walk around before the Messenger arrives
# Listen to Cerces's evaluations of their murals
# Follow the Messenger and meet with Elder Caenis
# Cross through Janus's Hidden Passage
# Follow the Messenger and meet with Elder Caenis
# Keep following Caenis
# Speak with Caenis
# Speak with Caenis and form an alliance
# Speak with Lygus
# Keep following Lygus
# Walk with the divine and ascend the Titan Cliff
# Continue climbing the mountain and investigate the phantoms that appeared when the soul left the body
# Continue your climb and have an audience with Kephale's divine vessel

